    {
      "id": "text-07-assistant-rich",
      "kind": "Assistant",
      "status": "Done",
      "html": "<h3>找到原因了</h3>\n<p>帳戶沒有登入時，<code>WaitForLoginAsync</code> 沒有逾時；登入視窗被關掉後，它就一直等下去，<code>loginBusy</code> 也不會清掉。我做了三件事：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>加上 <strong>3 分鐘</strong>逾時，逾時回傳 <code>LoginResult.TimedOut</code></li>\n<li>登入視窗關閉時立即重新檢查狀態</li>\n<li>補上 4 個單元測試，涵蓋逾時、關閉視窗與成功三種情況</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情境</th>\n<th>修改前</th>\n<th>修改後</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>關掉登入視窗</td>\n<td>一直顯示「登入中」</td>\n<td>立即回報「登入沒有完成」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 分鐘沒有完成</td>\n<td>一直等待</td>\n<td>逾時並可以重新登入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正常登入</td>\n<td>正常</td>\n<td>正常</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<pre><code class=\"language-csharp\">using var cts = new CancellationTokenSource(LoginTimeout);\nvar ok = await WaitForLoginAsync(account, cts.Token);\nif (!ok)\n{\n    return LoginResult.TimedOut(account.Id);\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>參考：<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/standard/threading/cancellation-in-managed-threads\">受控執行緒的取消</a>。修改的檔案：<a href=\"https://myriagent.local/open?path=C%3A%5Crepo%5Cmyriagent%5Csrc%5CMyriagent%5CAccounts%5CAccountManager.cs\">AccountManager.cs</a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>逾時時間之後可以在設定檔調整。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>巢狀清單\n<ul>\n<li>第二層 <em>斜體</em> 與 <del>刪除</del></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
      "time": 1784077620000,
      "seq": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "text-08-assistant-local-files",
      "kind": "Assistant",
      "status": "Done",
      "html": "<p>圖表與截圖：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://myriagent.local/media?path=C%3A%5Crepo%5Cmyriagent%5Cassets%5C%E7%94%A8%E9%87%8F%E5%9C%96%E8%A1%A8-%E6%9C%AC%E9%80%B1.png\" alt=\"圖表\" /><br />\n<img src=\"https://myriagent.local/media?path=C%3A%5Crepo%5Cmyriagent%5Cdocs%5C%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A.pdf\" alt=\"報告\" /><br />\n<img src=\"https://myriagent.local/media?path=C%3A%5Crepo%5Cmyriagent%5Cassets%5C%E7%99%BB%E5%85%A5%E7%95%AB%E9%9D%A2-%E4%BF%AE%E6%AD%A3%E5%BE%8C.png\" alt=\"修正後\" /><br />\n<img src=\"https://myriagent.local/media?path=C%3A%5Crepo%5Cmyriagent%5Cassets%5C%E7%99%BB%E5%85%A5%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E7%A4%BA%E7%AF%84.mp4\" alt=\"示範影片\" /><br />\n<img src=\"https://myriagent.local/media?path=C%3A%5Crepo%5Capp%5C.screenshots%5Chome.png\" alt=\"shot\" /><br />\n<img src=\"https://myriagent.local/media?path=C%3A%5Cmy%20files%5C.cache%5Ca%20b.png\" alt=\"含空白\" /><br />\n<img src=\"https://myriagent.local/media?path=C%3A%5Cout%5Ca%20b.png\" alt=\"file 網址\" /><br />\n<img src=\"https://myriagent.local/media?path=C%3A%5Crepo%5Cmyriagent%5Cassets%5C%E7%94%A8%E9%87%8F%E5%9C%96%E8%A1%A8-%E6%9C%AC%E9%80%B1.png\" alt=\"再一次圖表\" /><br />\n<a href=\"#\">網路共用</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://myriagent.local/media?path=C%3A%5Crepo%5Cshared%5Clogo.png\" alt=\"上一層\" /></p>\n<p>連結：<a href=\"https://myriagent.local/open?path=C%3A%5Crepo%5Cmyriagent%5Csrc%5CWeb%5Capp.js\">app.js:42</a>、<a href=\"https://myriagent.local/open?path=C%3A%5Crepo%5CREADME.md\">上層 README</a>、<a href=\"https://myriagent.local/open?path=C%3A%5Crepo%5Ca.cs\">a.cs:12</a>、<a href=\"https://myriagent.local/open?path=C%3A%5Crepo%5Capp%5C.github%5Cworkflows%5Cci.yml\">ci.yml</a>、<a href=\"https://myriagent.local/open?path=C%3A%5Crepo%5Cmyriagent%5Cdocs%5Ca%20b.md\">同層</a>、<a href=\"#\">資料流</a>、<a href=\"#\">章節</a>、<a href=\"#\">根目錄</a></p>\n<p>文字裡的路徑：截圖存在 <a href=\"https://myriagent.local/open?path=C%3A%5Crepo%5Cmyriagent%5Cassets%5C%E7%94%A8%E9%87%8F%E5%9C%96%E8%A1%A8-%E6%9C%AC%E9%80%B1.png\">C:\\repo\\myriagent\\assets\\用量圖表-本週.png</a>，設定在 <a href=\"https://myriagent.local/open?path=C%3A%5Crepo%5Capp%5C.github%5Cworkflows%5Cci.yml\">C:\\repo\\app\\.github\\workflows\\ci.yml</a>、錯誤在 <a href=\"https://myriagent.local/open?path=C%3A%5Crepo%5Ca.cs\">C:/repo/a.cs:42:7</a>。<br />\n行內程式碼 <a href=\"https://myriagent.local/open?path=C%3A%5Cmy%20files%5C%E5%A0%B1%E8%A1%A8%20v2.xlsx\"><code>C:\\my files\\報表 v2.xlsx</code></a> 與指令 <code>C:\\tools\\x.exe --help</code>；<strong><a href=\"https://myriagent.local/open?path=C%3A%5Cout%5Cmy_file_name.txt\">C:\\out\\my_file_name.txt</a></strong>、網址 <a href=\"https://example.com/C:/x\">https://example.com/C:/x</a> 與 <a href=\"https://myriagent.local/open?path=C%3A%5Cout%5Ca.txt\">C:\\out\\a.txt</a> 不重複</p>\n",
